# Route: guide 17 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 38 to
# 40, 26 quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Badlands, Darnassus, Dustwallow Marsh): Agmond's End -> Valley of
# Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs -> Agmond's End -> Valley of Fangs
# -> The Maker's Terrace -> Agmond's End -> The Dustbowl -> Kargath -> The
# Dustbowl -> Hammertoe's Digsite -> Valley of Fangs -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Black Box (708; Zaricotl
# 55-56); Shadowshard Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard
# Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1559 Flash Bomb
# Recipe.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Ribbly Screwspigot (4136), Kibler's Exotic Pets (4729),
# En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (4862), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls
# (1199), Tiara of the Deep (2846).

